or their first 24 hours as a fraud-prevention measure.", "reference_indexes": [3]}, {"snippet": "Bank & App Variations: Individual banks and apps (such as Google Pay, PhonePe, or Paytm) may set lower internal daily transaction counts or value caps."}], "reference_indexes": [3, 4]}, {"type": "paragraph", "snippet": "If you'd like, let me know:"}, {"type": "list", "list": [{"snippet": "Which bank or UPI app you are using"}, {"snippet": "What type of transaction you are trying to make"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "snippet": "I can check if your specific institution has a custom limit."}], "references": [{"index": 0, "title": "Latest UPI Payment Rules Effective Oct 2026 Explained", "link": "https://www.idfcfirst.bank.in/finfirst-blogs/savings-account/latest-upi-payment-rules-charges-limits-explained", "snippet": "From 15 October 2026, a Merchant Discount Rate (MDR) of 0.4% applies to most merchant UPI payments above ₹2,000, while P2P transfers stay free. UPI transaction lim...", "source": "IDFC FIRST Bank", "source_icon": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url=https://www.idfcfirst.bank.in&client=AIM&size=128&type=FAVICON&fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL", "thumbnail": "https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcR-5uGlTxjR12oTaEKoDRW6bpoE8EGXMM-rfKML1SVB62iqJ4J1Un2ZTBVQhTAgZrJUxzLevaOQIGb4C7rzOs8Lrv1biI3h0U4Zk6D8"}, {"index": 1, "title": "How Much Amount Can Be Transferred Through UPI In 2026?", "link": "https://www.oxigenwallet.com/upi/maximum-amount-transfer/", "snippet": "You can send up to ₹1,00,000 per transaction through regular UPI payments, with a daily limit of ₹1,00,000 for most person-to-person transfers. However, certain ty...", "source": "Oxigen Wallet", "source_icon": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url=https://www.oxigenwallet.com&client=AIM&size=128&type=FAVICON&fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL", "thumbnail": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTDxiUXas9qwP-dybEAETm5zkGMwUHrYG0hh6FOKsCEAeP7tCHrruChErqu7NSuy_YLOx